Active processing BACnet-compliant building controllers connected to other BACnet-compliant controllers together with their power supplies and associated equipment.
Addressable elements, sensors, transducers and end devices.
Third-party equipment interfaces and gateways as described and required by the Contract Documents.
Other components required for a complete and working Control Systems as specified.
