Outdoor air temperature sensors shall have watertight inlet fittings and be shielded from direct sunlight.
Room security sensors shall have stainless steel cover plate with insulated back and security screws.
Wire: Twisted, shielded-pair cable.
Output Signal: 4-20 mA or 0-10 VDC.
