Output 4 to 20 milliamp or 0-10 VDC.
Setpoint range 60 percent RH to 95 percent RH.
Proportional Band range 5 percent to 30 percent.
Auxiliary contacts for alarms.
Accuracy 2 percent RH and drift less than 0.5 percent per year.
