Operating range: -0.25 to +0.25 inches of water column
Resolution: 5 percent of reading
Accuracy: +/- 10 percent of reading +/- 0.005 inches of water column
Analog output: 4-20 ma or 0-10 VDC
Operating temperature range: 32 degrees F - 120 degrees F
